WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
The door is blocked by your house

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,400
If not you, who else could it be?

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,720
Who knows if your own children took it?

4
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,760
Don't pour any dirty water on us

5
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:09,720
I was still prying open the door last night

6
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,400
Let’s start raking today

7
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,960
Don't be bad

8
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,040
We don’t care about other people’s affairs

9
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:19,810
Just don't move to the fifteenth floor

10
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:20,970
Go wherever you like

11
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:25,460
Stop flushing the toilet upstairs.

12
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,980
The sewer has moved upwards

13
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,180
The house is full of smelly water

14
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:29,580
There's nothing we can do

15
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:30,820
You can't hold it back, right?

16
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,300
Then I'll move directly to your house

17
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,580
help each other

18
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:34,820
Just wait until the rain stops

19
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,140
Who else charges rice at a high price?

20
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,660
Five hundred pounds of rice

21
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,580
First come first served

22
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,330
Fifty-one buckets of instant noodles

23
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:42,250
There are twenty barrels left

24
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,840
Is there any rice?

25
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,360
My family is almost out of food.

26
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:46,360
You can buy it with extra money

27
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:47,920
It’s okay to be miserable sometimes

28
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,360
At least no one will doubt it in the future

29
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,720
I have a lot of stuff at home
